{"id": "86047", "name": "הצבה – x/(x²+a), תוצאה לוגריתמית (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Using the method of integration by substitution, find the following integral:</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,d{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Choose the new variable, express the differential through it, integrate in the new variable and substitute back.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The substitution</b><br><p>We need to calculate</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} \\]</p><p>by means of the substitution \\(u={{CT:2}}\\).</p><div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">Substitution: \\( \\int f(g(x))\\,g'(x)\\,dx=\\int f(u)\\,du,\\ u=g(x) \\)</div><p>So, if \\(u = {{CT:2}}\\) then \\(d{{CT:3}} = {{CT:4}} d{{CT:1}}\\), so, \\(d{{CT:1}} = d{{CT:3}}/{{CT:4}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The integral in terms of the new variable</b><br><p>Hence,</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} &= \\int {{CT:5}} \\frac{d{{CT:3}}}{{CT:4}} \\\\&= \\int {{CT:6}} d{{CT:3}} \\\\&= {{CT:7}} \\int {{CT:8}} d{{CT:3}} \\\\&= {{CT:7}}{{CT:9}} \\\\&= {{CT:10}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "int", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "int(p,v)+c", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["dumvar6", "p", "pp1", "pp2", "rdm1", "v"], "nvariants": 12}